# Replaces the planner's world. An empty request clears it. Points are voxelized into cubes of
# `point_voxel` (0 = 0.05 m) in whatever room the boxes leave in the obstacle cache.
curobo_bridge_msgs/Box[] boxes
sensor_msgs/PointCloud2 points
float64 point_voxel
---
bool success
uint32 box_count
string message
